        supported: true,
        description: 'After winning a trick, optionally declare one king-horse combination: 40 points if in trumps, 20 in another suit. Must declare 40 before 20 if both held. Show the two cards.',
        cost: '0',
        constraints: 'Only immediately after winning a trick, before leading to the next. At most one declaration per trick. Not obligatory.',
